Brainstorms/

# Personal state snapshots in assets/
assets/Projects/Banks/*.imbank
assets/Projects/States/*.imstate

# The repo-root assets/ is a LOCAL working folder (source models, Poser
# exports, scans) — kept here, never pushed. What the app serves and ships
# lives in public/assets/. The two files below were tracked before this rule
# and stay tracked: preview.png is the README image.
/assets/*
!/assets/Harabara-optimized.glb
!/assets/preview.png

# localStorage exports — per-origin user data, not factory content
glsl-user-presets-backup.json
*-presets-backup.json

# Obsidian
# docs/imweb-obsidian.md is deliberately TRACKED. It is the project knowledge
# base. While ignored it had no backup of any kind — not git, not Time Machine,
# not an Obsidian vault — and on 2026-08-12 a stale editor buffer overwrote it,
# destroying ~322 lines covering 2026-05-17 → 2026-07-29. Do not re-add it here.

